// 测试专用对象生成器（native_*_probe.tx）共用：按目标选汇编缓冲（arm64 为 A64）、提交，按目标写目标文件——Linux ELF、
// macOS Mach-O、Windows COFF。环境变量 TAIXU_PROBE_FORMAT=elf 在 macOS 目标上改写 ELF（独立核对 Mach-O 写出用：同一映像
// 两种格式对照）。退出码：0 成功，66 汇编失败，67 写出器拒绝，68 写文件失败。
import { StructuredBuffer, asBufferNew, asBufferNewA64, asBufferSubmit, asStructuredBegin, asFailedAs, asLastErrAs } from "./selfhost/assemble";
import { a64BufferSubmit } from "./selfhost/a64_asm";
import { elfWriteObject, elfObjectOk, elfObjectBytes, elfObjectError } from "./selfhost/emit_elf_object";
import { machoWriteObject } from "./selfhost/emit_macho_object";
import { coffCaptureAssembler, coffWrite, coffResultOk, coffResultBytes, coffResultError } from "./selfhost/emit_coff_storage";
import { tElf, tMacos, tA64 } from "./selfhost/target";

export function probeBuffer(t: int): Ref<StructuredBuffer> {
    if (tA64(t)) { return asBufferNewA64(); }
    return asBufferNew();
}

export function probeWrite(buf: Ref<StructuredBuffer>, t: int, path: string, exports: List<string>): int {
    asStructuredBegin();
    if (tA64(t)) { a64BufferSubmit(buf); } else { asBufferSubmit(buf); }
    if (asFailedAs() != 0) { eprint(asLastErrAs()); return 66; }
    let bytes = bytesNew(0);
    if (tMacos(t) && (getEnv("TAIXU_PROBE_FORMAT") catch "") != "elf") {
        const result = machoWriteObject(exports);
        if (!result.ok) { eprint(result.error); return 67; }
        bytes = result.bytes;
    } else if (tElf(t) || tMacos(t)) {
        const result = elfWriteObject(exports);
        if (elfObjectOk(result) != 1) { eprint(elfObjectError(result)); return 67; }
        bytes = elfObjectBytes(result);
    } else {
        const result = coffWrite(coffCaptureAssembler(), exports);
        if (coffResultOk(result) != 1) { eprint(coffResultError(result)); return 67; }
        bytes = coffResultBytes(result);
    }
    writeFileBytes(path, bytes) catch (e) { eprint(e.message); return 68; };
    return 0;
}
